# Behavioral Genetics: Concepts for Research and Practice in Language Development and Disorders.

**Authors:** Gilger, Jeffrey W.

## Abstract
This paper is an introduction to behavioral genetics for researchers and practitioners in language development and disorders. It identifies essential concepts and applies behavioral genetic research to the language sciences. It suggests that more complex questions may be successfully addressed through behavioral genetic paradigms. Research needs are identified and appropriate methodology are suggested. (Author/DB)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ513493

